<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Tuesday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK			  RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			     3-mths	  6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America    11.65/11.50    12.10/11.95    12.60/12.525</p>
<p>BPI		    11.65/11.50    12.20/12.05    12.65/12.55</p>
<p>Citibank	     11.65/11.50    12.25/12.00    12.625/12.525</p>
<p>Metrobank	    11.65/11.45    12.30/11.95    12.70/12.45</p>
<p>Multinational	11.55 /11.45   12.125/11.95   12.55/12.425</p>
<p>PNB		    11.60/11.50    12.125/12.00   12.625/12.575</p>
<p>StanChart	    11.575/11.475  12.10/12.00    12.60 /12.525</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>* To contribute to this page, please fax your quotes to Reuters Manila newsroom on (632) 817 6267. For details, please phone on (632) 841 8934</p>
